# Samsung Galaxy S5 Active (SC-02G / kltedcmactive) Hardware Keys
# Physical Navigation Click Buttons (Front)
key 102   HOME              WAKE
key 158   BACK              WAKE
key 254   APP_SWITCH        WAKE

# Volume & Power Buttons
key 115   VOLUME_UP
key 114   VOLUME_DOWN
key 116   POWER             WAKE

# Dedicated Active Key (Orange Side Button - GPIO 91)
key 249   FAVORITES         WAKE
